  #line-at(70.8pt, 81.72pt, "Akaike information criterion (AIC) [39], was employed. The application of AIC has proven to ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 95.52pt, "be effective not only in the domain of acoustic emissions [40], but also in other data analysis ")
