  #line-at(70.8pt, 495.72pt, "its inherent methodological constraint - namely the use of a rigid grid - limits its ability to ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 509.52pt, "consistently achieve the objectives defined in this paper. Consequently, a methodology referred ")
