  #line-at(70.8pt, 578.52pt, "computed and utilized as the basis for the evaluation of the TVE and REA metrics. Therefore, ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 592.32pt, "the preliminary determination of NOS was made through the implementation of a sample size ")
