  #line-at(70.8pt, 81.84pt, "Appendix C ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(70.8pt, 109.08pt, "The present appendix provides a schematic representation of the formation and calculation of ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 122.88pt, "the \"difference of thermal diffusion length\" between the reference and defective areas for the ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 136.68pt, "CFRP plate employed in the present study. Firstly, a theoretical thermal simulation is performed ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 150.48pt, "for each ROI area (a 1-layer model representing the reference area and a 3-layer model ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 164.28pt, "representing the defective area) and the frequency-dependent diffusion depth is calculated. ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 178.08pt, "Subsequently, the difference between these values is calculated and displayed in a diagram for ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 191.88pt, "all six ROIs. These curves represent the frequency-dependent contrast between the defective ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 205.68pt, "and defect-free or reference areas. ")
]

